# sqlite3 is pinned to 5.x in package.json: its prebuilt native binaries are
# built against an older GLIBC and load cleanly on Render's runtime image.
# (sqlite3 6.x prebuilts required GLIBC_2.38, which Render didn't have — the
# crash we hit before. Pinning the version also busts Render's build cache so
# the new binary is actually fetched.)
# node-pre-gyp falls back to a source build automatically if no matching
# prebuilt exists, so we no longer force `build-from-source`.
